---

---
<section class="contenedor layout-gap overflow-wrapper">
  <div>
    <div class="heading-align left">
      <div class="title-wrapper arrow-left">
        <h2>The problem</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <ul class="custom-list">
      <li>Accelerator physics is critical for medicine, industry, and research.</li>
      <li>There is a gap between student training and the real needs of the sector.</li>
      <li>Most universities do not have access to accelerators due to cost, complexity, and security.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div id="solution">
    <div class="heading-align right">
      <div class="title-wrapper arrow-right">
        <h2>Projects</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid-2-col cards-grid">
      <div class="card card-centered">
        <h3 class="card-title">Model</h3>
        <img src="/m2.webp" alt="M-2" class="card-img" width="300" height="200" />
        <p class="card-subtitle">A minimal model of an accelerator system, including vacuum, high voltage and a visible electron beam.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card card-centered">
        <h3 class="card-title">ALOHA</h3>
        <img src="/aloha.webp" alt="ALOHA Accelerator" class="card-img" width="300" height="200" />
        <p class="card-subtitle">A safe, modular, and affordable desktop accelerator.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Stops the overhanging arrow lines from creating horizontal scroll */

  .layout-gap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5rem;
  }

  /* Heading alignment */
/* Custom list (squares instead of bullets) */
  .custom-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 3.5rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: 2rem;
  }

  .custom-list li {
    position: relative;
    font-family: var(--ff-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .custom-list li::before {
    content: "▪";
    position: absolute;
    left: -1.5rem;
    color: var(--c-text);
    font-size: 1.2em; /* Makes the square slightly more visible */
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* Centered cards */
  .cards-grid {
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .card-centered {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(30, 30, 50, 0.4); /* Slight tweak so it stands out from the background */
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  /* Mobile tweaks */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .custom-list {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
